WEBVTT

01:33.520 --> 01:36.240
IMPERIAL PHYSICIAN'S HALL

02:02.760 --> 02:03.600
Xiaoqing,

02:03.680 --> 02:04.680
you're awake.

02:05.720 --> 02:07.640
You were banging around outside.

02:08.639 --> 02:10.520
How could I possibly sleep?

02:13.000 --> 02:14.800
This reminds me of when we were kids.

02:15.400 --> 02:16.680
I wanted to sleep,

02:17.480 --> 02:19.000
but you were outside beating a drum,

02:19.080 --> 02:23.000
telling Master
you were training your arms.

02:25.000 --> 02:25.840
Xiaoqing,

02:25.920 --> 02:28.160
this time,
I didn't wake you up on purpose.

02:31.600 --> 02:32.640
Xiaoqing,

02:37.280 --> 02:38.280
let's leave.

02:40.400 --> 02:41.360
Where to?

02:43.480 --> 02:44.400
I don't know.

02:45.680 --> 02:47.240
But if we stay here,

02:47.760 --> 02:49.040
we'll only become hostages,

02:49.640 --> 02:52.480
and Huai'an and the pageboy
will end up doing things

02:53.200 --> 02:56.920
they don't want to do
just to keep us safe.

02:58.120 --> 02:59.480
With the skills I have,

03:01.320 --> 03:04.320
I can't drag them down, right?

03:06.200 --> 03:07.800
So I want to take you and break out.

03:08.960 --> 03:10.840
Either we die and be done with it,

03:11.880 --> 03:14.360
or we fight our way out.

03:15.240 --> 03:16.200
Sure.

03:18.280 --> 03:19.920
Sounds heroic.

03:23.880 --> 03:24.720
All right.

03:25.360 --> 03:27.040
BATTLE AT CANGSHUI RIVER,
CASUALTIES LIKELY

03:37.280 --> 03:38.400
FRESH HARVEST RICE, GRAIN

05:05.880 --> 05:07.440
Play the prey first.

05:11.720 --> 05:13.600
Then kill the hunter.

06:39.600 --> 06:40.520
Don't.

06:43.920 --> 06:45.000
You won't be able to kill him.

06:46.960 --> 06:48.440
I came to Cangshui River

06:49.320 --> 06:50.520
for this very moment.

06:52.920 --> 06:54.240
Protect His Majesty.

06:54.960 --> 06:55.920
Take him back.

07:02.280 --> 07:03.440
Your Majesty.

07:39.160 --> 07:40.760
You dare to come kill me?

07:40.840 --> 07:45.280
Didn't you say you would
save the greatest advantage for yourself?

07:45.960 --> 07:47.360
Why did you come to Cangshui River?

07:49.120 --> 07:50.800
Once Xiao Wuyang is dead,

07:50.880 --> 07:52.120
the outcome will be set.

07:52.640 --> 07:54.080
Why wouldn't I come?

07:54.160 --> 07:56.440
Killing you will bring peace to the realm.

07:56.520 --> 07:58.360
Why would I not dare to kill you?

08:06.000 --> 08:06.840
Your Majesty.

08:10.400 --> 08:11.680
Kill him.

08:11.760 --> 08:12.680
Understood.

08:32.159 --> 08:33.000
Your Majesty.

08:34.760 --> 08:35.880
You're gravely wounded.

08:36.400 --> 08:37.919
It's nothing. I won't die yet.

08:38.000 --> 08:40.600
Too bad I couldn't cut down Xiao Wuyang.

08:41.880 --> 08:44.159
He is a terrifying opponent.

08:45.200 --> 08:48.000
Xie Huai'an must have
seen through your plan

08:48.080 --> 08:50.280
and warned Xiao Wuyang in advance.

08:50.800 --> 08:53.720
This round is the heavenly calamity
foretold in the divinations.

08:54.520 --> 08:56.400
He could only guess one part of it.

08:58.560 --> 09:01.760
How are things on the other side?

09:01.840 --> 09:02.960
Your Majesty,

09:04.120 --> 09:05.800
you gave me four liang of gold.

09:06.640 --> 09:08.040
Running errands for you cost one.

09:08.560 --> 09:11.200
Killing those Tiemo lackeys
just now cost two.

09:12.080 --> 09:13.240
There's still one liang left.

09:13.960 --> 09:15.400
I can do one more thing for you.

09:17.800 --> 09:18.880
All right.

09:20.280 --> 09:23.000
Go watch over the salt shop's owner.

09:23.520 --> 09:24.880
He and I go way back.

09:24.960 --> 09:27.280
-Now?
-Yes, now.

09:27.360 --> 09:28.680
Keep him safe,

09:28.760 --> 09:30.520
so I'll have no more worries.

09:30.600 --> 09:31.640
Understand?

09:40.600 --> 09:42.600
This guy looks unfamiliar.

09:43.200 --> 09:44.400
Don't worry.

09:44.480 --> 09:46.040
He can't kill me.

09:47.680 --> 09:48.640
Go on.

10:34.960 --> 10:37.440
Fang Genghui… With his swordplay,

10:38.320 --> 10:39.640
would he be able to wound me?

10:41.600 --> 10:43.800
Your Majesty,
you are the one who can turn the tide.

10:43.880 --> 10:45.440
Fang Genghui is nowhere near you.

10:49.240 --> 10:51.040
If he can't harm me,

10:51.800 --> 10:54.080
then he can't harm Xiao Wuyang either.

10:56.080 --> 10:57.920
But that's enough.

11:02.000 --> 11:03.640
It's about time.

11:05.280 --> 11:07.680
Come on, let's finish this.

11:43.720 --> 11:44.920
What's wrong?

12:02.080 --> 12:03.000
Why?

12:58.800 --> 13:00.560
Must you really kill them?

13:03.920 --> 13:05.240
Read the military report

13:05.840 --> 13:06.920
sent to Chang'an yourself.

13:07.960 --> 13:10.080
Compared to what's written there,

13:10.160 --> 13:11.920
a few dead couriers

13:14.080 --> 13:15.600
are nothing.

13:21.960 --> 13:23.480
GUODONG, LEFT GENERAL OF THE BAIWENHU ARMY

13:23.560 --> 13:24.920
On the 11th day of the second month,

13:25.000 --> 13:27.040
Tiemo gathered a force of over 200,000.

13:27.120 --> 13:29.400
They crossed the border in full force.

13:30.240 --> 13:31.760
The Baiwenhu Army retreated 70 li…

13:31.840 --> 13:32.800
-Charge!
-…in one day.

13:36.360 --> 13:37.600
On the 14th,

13:37.680 --> 13:39.400
Tiemo forces broke through Shifu Pass.

13:40.000 --> 13:42.160
There was no natural defense
in North Office.

13:44.240 --> 13:46.280
NORTH OFFICE

13:52.760 --> 13:53.680
On the 15th,

13:54.400 --> 13:55.240
the North Office fell.

13:56.080 --> 13:59.120
Tiemo's vanguard
was just 1,300 li from Chang'an.

14:21.080 --> 14:22.360
We have waited decades

14:23.120 --> 14:24.560
for this battle.

14:25.800 --> 14:27.760
In the last two generations of Tiemo,

14:28.280 --> 14:30.960
every man as tall
as a horsewhip is a warrior.

14:32.000 --> 14:34.440
With Gu Yu dead, the Baiwenhu Army

14:34.960 --> 14:36.480
lost its commander and its morale.

14:37.600 --> 14:41.240
No one can stop
my warhorses from charging south.

14:42.840 --> 14:44.080
Once past the North Office,

14:44.160 --> 14:46.080
it is the territory
of the regional commanders.

14:46.600 --> 14:49.120
These men long for the empire's collapse

14:49.200 --> 14:50.720
so they can crown themselves kings.

14:50.800 --> 14:52.360
None of them

14:54.680 --> 14:57.520
will send troops to aid Chang'an.

14:58.600 --> 15:02.040
Your nation is destined
to drown in bloodshed.

15:04.000 --> 15:06.000
You keep showing me these reports

15:07.120 --> 15:09.400
and speaking of your great ambitions.

15:10.480 --> 15:11.960
What are you trying to do?

15:12.680 --> 15:17.040
My 200,000 Tiemo warriors may not be able
to trample every corner of your land.

15:17.960 --> 15:19.040
I need you

15:19.760 --> 15:21.000
to be my puppet emperor.

15:23.760 --> 15:25.600
You will be cursed by the people,

15:26.360 --> 15:28.480
but you will at least be able
to keep part of the realm.

15:29.760 --> 15:31.680
When the treaty is signed
between our two nations,

15:32.640 --> 15:34.200
I will leave you half of Chang'an.

15:35.480 --> 15:38.280
My empire is vast,
and you offer me half of Chang'an?

15:38.360 --> 15:39.920
What kind of treaty is this?

15:40.440 --> 15:42.880
You're forcing me
to betray my own country!

15:46.680 --> 15:47.880
Very well.

15:56.080 --> 15:57.280
Either you cooperate,

15:58.080 --> 15:59.760
or I take your land by force.

16:01.560 --> 16:02.600
Go ahead and choose.

16:17.200 --> 16:18.480
Why me?

16:19.760 --> 16:22.480
Because you're not like
your brother Xiao Wuyang.

16:23.400 --> 16:26.200
If it were him, he would drag me down

16:26.800 --> 16:28.000
and perish with me.

16:29.280 --> 16:30.560
So I can only choose you.

16:34.320 --> 16:36.280
Aren't you afraid I'll do the same?

16:36.360 --> 16:39.080
Then I will enthrone a fake emperor
like Yan Fengshan did.

16:39.160 --> 16:40.560
It will make no difference to me.

16:40.640 --> 16:41.520
But you,

16:41.600 --> 16:42.760
born into the imperial clan,

16:42.840 --> 16:46.080
will become a disgrace who never
shouldered the burden of the realm!

17:00.080 --> 17:01.240
An emperor

17:03.680 --> 17:05.160
is fated to loneliness.

17:06.400 --> 17:09.000
Some may understand
that you had no choice,

17:09.560 --> 17:11.079
but in this world,

17:12.040 --> 17:13.800
there are too few wise enough to see it.

18:17.720 --> 18:19.320
CHANGLE OUTPOST

18:41.400 --> 18:42.440
If

18:43.400 --> 18:46.560
I were to agree to your proposal,

18:48.560 --> 18:49.840
what would happen to my brother?

18:50.640 --> 18:52.440
Xiao Wuyang is not easy to kill,

18:54.600 --> 18:56.200
but I have devised a plan,

18:58.000 --> 19:00.080
and you will be my final killing move.

19:03.080 --> 19:05.440
The two of you are brothers by blood.

19:07.720 --> 19:10.160
And when he was gravely injured,
you took care of him.

19:11.640 --> 19:13.040
In this world,

19:13.560 --> 19:15.280
you are the only one

19:16.920 --> 19:18.360
he lets his guard down around.

19:28.840 --> 19:30.040
Very well.

19:33.840 --> 19:35.200
I will be

19:37.640 --> 19:38.880
your puppet emperor.

19:54.360 --> 19:55.960
I did it for Chang'an,

19:57.080 --> 19:58.200
for the realm!

20:12.680 --> 20:13.560
Look at you.

20:16.000 --> 20:17.120
You accomplished something

20:18.040 --> 20:20.360
none of them ever could.

20:23.360 --> 20:24.280
Remember this:

20:26.840 --> 20:28.120
you have grown up.

20:29.880 --> 20:31.240
From today on,

20:32.720 --> 20:34.200
hold your head high.

20:44.000 --> 20:45.400
Remember your own words.

20:47.120 --> 20:48.480
You did it for Chang'an

20:50.920 --> 20:52.520
and for the realm.

20:54.640 --> 20:56.040
I am giving back

20:59.240 --> 21:00.400
to you

21:01.720 --> 21:03.280
what was meant to be yours.

21:51.160 --> 21:53.160
Such lengths I went to

21:54.280 --> 21:56.040
just to kill you.

21:57.600 --> 21:59.440
Indeed.

22:00.720 --> 22:01.840
Such trickery.

22:02.800 --> 22:04.080
Not kingly at all.

22:08.640 --> 22:10.080
Fifteen years ago,

22:10.880 --> 22:12.800
when Yan Fengshan killed Liu Ziwen,

22:13.600 --> 22:15.640
he already knew my identity.

22:15.720 --> 22:18.040
He secretly mobilized the troops

22:18.120 --> 22:20.040
and sealed off the northern front.

22:21.280 --> 22:23.480
My years of effort hiding and planning

22:24.360 --> 22:27.000
went to waste just like that.

22:28.120 --> 22:29.680
So

22:29.760 --> 22:33.880
I traveled alone
toward the northern lands of Tiemo.

22:35.320 --> 22:36.880
That journey home

22:37.760 --> 22:39.200
felt

22:39.960 --> 22:42.480
like a long night
that would never see dawn.

22:46.960 --> 22:49.640
But when I stood again on Tiemo soil,

22:50.400 --> 22:52.080
the people in the ritual hall

22:52.680 --> 22:54.800
came out of Mount Shiluoman

22:55.720 --> 22:57.440
and placed the golden crown

22:58.080 --> 22:59.960
of the Tiemo King on my head.

23:00.640 --> 23:03.640
They believed I could carry Tiemo's hopes

23:04.320 --> 23:07.640
and lead them out of the bitter cold.

23:08.760 --> 23:10.760
So I returned to Chang'an,

23:12.280 --> 23:14.720
locking myself willingly in Yulong Ridge.

23:15.680 --> 23:18.000
That was the beginning
of my path of trickery.

23:23.360 --> 23:24.720
Xiao Wuyang,

23:28.800 --> 23:30.680
you were born into royalty,

23:31.280 --> 23:33.360
while I was born a slave.

23:34.280 --> 23:36.240
We were never the same.

23:37.520 --> 23:38.720
But today,

23:40.080 --> 23:42.120
we are both gravely wounded

23:44.080 --> 23:46.000
and bearing the same solitude

23:46.880 --> 23:48.160
for the realm.

23:54.920 --> 23:56.000
Yes,

23:57.320 --> 23:58.400
Chang'an

23:59.560 --> 24:01.520
is a city many yearn for.

24:03.520 --> 24:04.600
How beautiful it is.

24:06.560 --> 24:08.080
Take one last look at it.

24:13.520 --> 24:14.680
Go on, look.

25:09.960 --> 25:10.840
You can't kill him!

25:22.160 --> 25:23.360
What did you promise me?

25:23.440 --> 25:25.640
You cannot kill him!

25:27.240 --> 25:28.480
I promised you.

25:29.000 --> 25:30.440
As long as he lives,

25:30.520 --> 25:32.840
you will willingly be my puppet.

25:32.920 --> 25:33.840
Isn't that right?

25:39.360 --> 25:40.280
Take him away.

26:07.000 --> 26:08.160
Are you going to make me

26:09.800 --> 26:11.720
live and eat with you

26:15.480 --> 26:17.080
or lock me up the way

26:17.960 --> 26:19.280
you are locking my brother up?

26:21.640 --> 26:22.920
If neither,

26:23.760 --> 26:25.360
then leave me alone for a while.

26:27.560 --> 26:30.000
Your Tiemo shadow guards
are everywhere already.

26:31.520 --> 26:32.720
I cannot escape.

26:35.560 --> 26:36.680
Let him be.

27:55.240 --> 27:56.520
Go.

27:57.160 --> 27:59.440
I will not see you again.

28:09.160 --> 28:10.240
Sir,

28:13.120 --> 28:14.760
I had no choice.

28:15.520 --> 28:17.760
Right. Right.

28:18.280 --> 28:20.000
You had your reasons.

28:20.520 --> 28:23.400
But I am just a common man.

28:24.040 --> 28:25.960
I cannot understand!

28:29.400 --> 28:30.520
I cannot understand

28:31.680 --> 28:33.480
what reason

28:35.840 --> 28:36.920
could make you

28:39.360 --> 28:41.920
stab your own brother!

28:43.800 --> 28:45.000
I cannot understand

28:46.400 --> 28:49.800
why you would side

28:50.840 --> 28:53.680
with the Tiemo people!

28:55.920 --> 28:56.880
I…

29:01.000 --> 29:04.040
I don't need you
to look after me in old age.

29:08.000 --> 29:10.120
You were never my son.

29:17.200 --> 29:18.680
You killed him.

29:21.600 --> 29:24.320
You killed my son.

29:26.640 --> 29:29.760
You killed my son!

29:32.440 --> 29:34.200
Oh, Mo!

29:35.400 --> 29:37.920
He died at the hands of someone like you.

29:38.000 --> 29:39.280
My poor boy!

29:56.400 --> 29:57.360
Get lost.

30:43.960 --> 30:45.120
I'm sorry.

30:47.880 --> 30:49.400
I'm sorry.

30:52.520 --> 30:54.800
I'm sorry!

32:27.960 --> 32:29.200
-Hurry.
-Coming.

33:30.840 --> 33:32.360
Remember your own words.

33:34.000 --> 33:35.440
You did it for Chang'an

33:37.800 --> 33:39.320
and for the realm.

33:41.520 --> 33:42.920
I am giving back

33:46.120 --> 33:47.120
to you

33:48.600 --> 33:49.960
what was meant to be yours.

34:11.480 --> 34:12.480
This battle

34:12.560 --> 34:13.600
has already exposed us.

34:14.520 --> 34:16.960
Should we leave the people
in Cangshui River alive?

34:17.600 --> 34:19.239
There are thousands in Cangshui River

34:19.760 --> 34:21.600
and hundreds of thousands in Chang'an.

34:22.120 --> 34:23.159
You cannot kill them all.

34:24.719 --> 34:26.199
The common folk are livestock.

34:27.800 --> 34:30.840
Hold your blade firmly,
and they will obey you.

34:31.800 --> 34:32.639
Understood.

34:33.600 --> 34:35.560
Any news of Xie Huai'an?

34:38.000 --> 34:39.120
Zhu Zhilong said he held

34:40.000 --> 34:41.880
the greatest authority in Cangshui River,

34:42.480 --> 34:45.159
and that Xie Huai'an's fate
would be decided here.

34:47.120 --> 34:49.639
He was the first
to enter Chang'an with me.

34:51.040 --> 34:53.239
He hid his identity for years,

34:53.320 --> 34:54.560
unafraid of death.

34:55.280 --> 34:57.720
I have never seen him this unsettled.

34:58.440 --> 34:59.760
He fears Your Majesty.

34:59.840 --> 35:02.320
You ordered him to kill Xie Huai'an,
but he failed.

35:02.400 --> 35:04.720
He does not fear me.

35:05.520 --> 35:07.560
He fears Xie Huai'an.

35:09.080 --> 35:11.240
Just now, that boy…

35:12.240 --> 35:14.080
Killing you will bring peace to the realm.

35:14.160 --> 35:15.720
Why would I not dare to kill you?

35:21.840 --> 35:23.240
He was one strike away

35:24.800 --> 35:26.040
from killing me.

35:31.240 --> 35:33.000
We will escort Your Majesty
back to Chang'an.

35:33.080 --> 35:35.400
Leave the matters in Cangshui River
to Zhu Zhilong.

35:35.480 --> 35:36.480
Very well.

36:35.720 --> 36:37.080
I was one strike from killing him.

36:38.600 --> 36:39.640
Then you showed up.

36:42.280 --> 36:44.480
You want Xiao Wuyang alive.

36:45.000 --> 36:46.600
I want the King alive.

36:46.680 --> 36:48.520
You and I are the same.

36:58.080 --> 36:59.560
What about your disciples?

37:00.240 --> 37:01.680
If your king lives,

37:02.200 --> 37:03.800
your disciples will die.

37:04.600 --> 37:08.040
Do you truly feel nothing for them?

37:08.560 --> 37:09.440
I arrived late

37:10.320 --> 37:12.800
because I was gathering men
to go to the clinic.

37:13.560 --> 37:15.320
The King and you have an agreement.

37:15.400 --> 37:16.760
But you and I do not.

37:17.280 --> 37:18.680
How ruthless.

37:19.200 --> 37:20.560
Do you not fear retribution?

37:21.480 --> 37:22.480
No.

37:23.040 --> 37:25.440
I have nothing left to lose.

37:27.360 --> 37:29.000
Do you care about the past?

37:30.600 --> 37:31.680
No.

37:34.480 --> 37:36.640
Everything I have done in this life

37:38.280 --> 37:40.600
is for Tiemo's future.

37:41.720 --> 37:42.760
White Hair,

37:43.800 --> 37:46.360
we have enough men in Chang'an

37:46.440 --> 37:48.440
and in Cangshui River.

37:49.200 --> 37:50.040
You are destined

37:51.240 --> 37:53.040
to lose this battle.

38:07.120 --> 38:08.400
We searched the entire shoal.

38:08.480 --> 38:09.320
No trace of him.

38:14.040 --> 38:15.320
No need to keep searching.

38:15.400 --> 38:17.720
But… we made a promise to the King.

38:18.560 --> 38:20.080
I thought of someone.

38:21.000 --> 38:22.560
Like me,

38:22.640 --> 38:25.360
he now has no family left.

38:27.280 --> 38:28.720
Xie Huai'an owes him,

38:29.600 --> 38:31.040
and yet that man

38:31.120 --> 38:33.840
still helps him without regard
for his own life.

38:36.440 --> 38:38.160
In all of Cangshui River,

38:38.680 --> 38:41.240
if Xie Huai'an still cares
about anyone's life,

38:43.720 --> 38:45.520
it must be his.

39:46.120 --> 39:47.600
You finally came.

39:55.680 --> 39:56.680
Yes, Master.

39:59.320 --> 40:00.480
I came to see you.
